        "job_description": "Defeat the $faction fleet in possession of an old item. You may use whatever you get from this as you wish, as long as the item doesn't stay in their hand.\nWe know they don't do much with it, but just to be safe.",
        "job_forFaction": "independent", # Default: no faction. Note that unless "job_reputation_reward" is set to 0, successfully completing a bounty will improve relations by 5 points.
        "job_credit_reward": 250000, # Default: no credit reward. Number of credits to award the player on successful completion.
